<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_appendix"><a href="#A4" title="In Test-Time Efficient Pretrained Model Portfolios for Time Series Forecasting" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">D </span>Details on Model Selection</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_appendix"><a href="#A5" title="In Test-Time Efficient Pretrained Model Portfolios for Time Series Forecasting" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">E </span>FLOPs Computation</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_appendix"><a href="#A6" title="In Test-Time Efficient Pretrained Model Portfolios for Time Series Forecasting" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">F </span>Bias–Variance in Foundation Model Portfolios</span></a></li>
