</figure>
<figure id="A7.F10" class="ltx_figure"><object type="image/svg+xml" data="2510.06419v1/amortized_ttc_best_post.svg" id="A7.F10.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:548/268;" width="548" height="268"></object>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 10: </span>Scaling behavior of Chroma portfolios with respect to the amortized test time compute, when the specialists are formed with post-training and model selection is performed during test-time.
</figcaption>
</figure>
<figure id="A7.F11" class="ltx_figure"><object type="image/svg+xml" data="2510.06419v1/amortized_ttc_ensemble_post.svg" id="A7.F11.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:548/268;" width="548" height="268"></object>
