<section id="A7.SS5" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">G.5 </span>Detailed Benchmark Results</h3>

<div id="A7.SS5.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A7.SS5.p1.1" class="ltx_p">While we provide the aggregated results in the main text, in this section, we provide detailed results for each individual dataset included in the benchmarks.
Specifically, for BM2, we report the results for WQL and MASE in Tables <a href="#A7.T9" title="Table 9 ‣ G.5 Detailed Benchmark Results ‣ Appendix G Additional Experiment Results ‣ Test-Time Efficient Pretrained Model Portfolios for Time Series Forecasting" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">9</span></a> and <a href="#A7.T10" title="Table 10 ‣ G.5 Detailed Benchmark Results ‣ Appendix G Additional Experiment Results ‣ Test-Time Efficient Pretrained Model Portfolios for Time Series Forecasting" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">10</span></a>, respectively.
For GIFT-Eval, WQL results are shown in Tables <a href="#A7.T11" title="Table 11 ‣ G.5 Detailed Benchmark Results ‣ Appendix G Additional Experiment Results ‣ Test-Time Efficient Pretrained Model Portfolios for Time Series Forecasting" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">11</span></a> and <a href="#A7.T12" title="Table 12 ‣ G.5 Detailed Benchmark Results ‣ Appendix G Additional Experiment Results ‣ Test-Time Efficient Pretrained Model Portfolios for Time Series Forecasting" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">12</span></a>, while MASE results are presented in Tables <a href="#A7.T13" title="Table 13 ‣ G.5 Detailed Benchmark Results ‣ Appendix G Additional Experiment Results ‣ Test-Time Efficient Pretrained Model Portfolios for Time Series Forecasting" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">13</span></a> and <a href="#A7.T14" title="Table 14 ‣ G.5 Detailed Benchmark Results ‣ Appendix G Additional Experiment Results ‣ Test-Time Efficient Pretrained Model Portfolios for Time Series Forecasting" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">14</span></a>.</p>
</div>
